# Nail — English texts of pop-out windows in the desktop app (M5c WP173):
# "Open in new window", "Return to main window", pop-out window titles.
# Texts named by the contract (pop-out changes and issues) are in
# core-windows.ftl.

## The title-bar button and the pop-out page

popout-open = Open in new window
# $reason (String) — why the last try failed
popout-open-error = Open in new window ({ $reason })
popout-return = Return to main window
popout-return-hint = Put this window back into Nail's main window

## Failures (popout-open-failed: the desktop app could not open the OS window)

popout-failed = This window could not be opened on its own.
popout-open-failed = The new window could not be opened.

## Command palette

popout-action-open = Open window in new window
popout-action-return = Return window to main window
popout-action-keywords = pop out separate window detach undock own window
